[h2]GORA UI+[/h2]

A polished set of quality-of-life UI improvements for Victoria 3, built to coexist with [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3385002128]Community Mod Framework[/url].
CMF is supported but not required. Without it, every core GORA feature still works — only the CMF-specific extension points stay dormant.
[list]
[*]Supported game version: [b]1.15.*[/b]
[*]It can be used in multiplayer and single player games.
[*][b]Ironman Compatible[/b]
[/list]

[h2]Discord[/h2]
https://discord.gg/SUygUwq3Tx

[h2]GitHub[/h2]
https://github.com/NoFires/GORA-UI/tree/main

[h2]✨Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*]Strategic Region and Capital State indicators on the state and country panels
[*]Quick-build buttons for Infrastructure, Tax Capacity, and common construction queue actions
[*]Country, state and trait filters across diplomatic and build-selection panels, plus clickable column sorting (Population, GDP, SoL, Peasants) on the Domestic Lens Decree state list
[*]Wider, themed market and world-market panels with market balance overview, construction-goods rollups, bulk-tariff buttons, and Smart Treaties partner recommendations
[*]Expanded building grid in the buildings tab
[*]New Capital tab in the budget panel with state-owned industry and net-worth tables
[*]Upgraded Parliament Visualizer (Improved ParliamentGraph 3.1): 5 chamber architectures (Westminster, Bicameral, Horseshoe, Assembly Hall, Hemicycle), 5 live seat apportionment formulas (Hare, D'Hondt, Sainte-Laguë, 5% Threshold, FPTP) linked to seat distribution & historical chamber size, 20+ country historical Upper/Lower chamber names, 5-election seat history, and an on-demand 3-view Foreign AI Parliament Viewer
[*]Drag-and-drop research queue reordering, expandable overflow row, and Latest Research indicator on the tech tree
[*]Tier-numbered ship silhouette icons for improved naval readability
[*]Advanced Officer Info panel on the general and admiral recruit pickers
[*]Richer GDP tooltips with growth rate, per-state breakdown and global context
[*]Softer, lower-contrast Victorian pie & treemap chart styling (Victorian Charts)
[/list]

[h2]🔧Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3385002128][1.15] Community Mod Framework[/url]
Built around the Community Mod Framework — wherever CMF extends a panel, GORA UI+ keeps its extension hooks intact so CMF-dependent mods continue to render alongside GORA additions.
⚠️ Do not enable standalone copies of mods already integrated below (e.g., Smart Treaties, Trade Partners, Expanded Topbar Framework, Reorder Research Queue).

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2889925770]Morgenröte - Dawn of Flavor[/url]

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3472248460]Tech & Res[/url]

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3199730217]Hail, Columbia![/url]

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2880089689]Victorian Flavor Mod[/url] 

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3219394272]Victorian Century[/url]
▶️Load Order ⬆️VC, ⬇️ GORA+

[*]📌[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3687767007]Parliament 2.0[/url]
▶️Load Order ⬆️ GORA+, ⬇️Parliament 2.0

[/list]

